ies were trying to figure out ways to induce psion and/or nova potential in humans, are they still trying to do that? </div> </div> </div>There\u2019s at least one.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Writer. Developer.</i> <b>World of Darkness</b> | <b>Chronicles of Darkness</b> | <b>The Trinity Continuum</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/156-bunyip","name":"Bunyip","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar156_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1880"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-28T09:42:12-07:00","id":1491610,"title":"","content":"I just bought it. Immediately I found a lost opportunity in the name: Should be Mission<b>\u00c6</b>statements.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1524-pcontop","name":"pcontop","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1524_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"278"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-28T12:24:47-07:00","id":1491633,"title":"","content":"I bought it but I haven\u2019t read it yet. Looking forward to reading it tonight.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Amethyst is my birthstone. She/they.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26996-amethyst","name":"Amethyst","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26996_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"873"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-28T14:34:47-07:00","id":1491657,"title":"","content":"For those who have bought a copy and have had a chance to read it, please add a review to the Drivethru page, even just hit the star rating you think it deserves. These things help.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Writer. Developer.</i> <b>World of Darkness</b> | <b>Chronicles of Darkness</b> | <b>The Trinity Continuum</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/156-bunyip","name":"Bunyip","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar156_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1880"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-29T04:17:58-07:00","id":1491739,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>pcontop</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1491574-mission-statements?p=1491610#post1491610\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I just bought it. Immediately I found a lost opportunity in the name: Should be Mission<b>\u00c6</b>statements.</div> </div> </div> </div><b>\u00c6</b>Mission Statements would be a very different book. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/ofii86boiyk38ng/DtDRandomForms.zip\" target=\"_blank\">Open the gates of Hell: Random Demon Generator.</a><br /> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1X6qQzoAPrSRNzl3cQcMWasoPv3eK56sIlAOTeay61No/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Gather an army of Rage! Random Garou Generator.</a><br /> Shapeshifting Historian<br /> Writer - Werewolf: the Apocalypse, Werewolf: the Forsaken, Exalted 3e, TC: \u00c6on","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/167-nikink","name":"nikink","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"360"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-29T17:16:25-07:00","id":1491836,"title":"","content":"I really love how the UN is presented, and how it is contrasted against the \u00c6on Trinity and psi orders. The book does a great job setting up dynamic tensions between the three without making any one of them sinister or being needlessly obstructionist. The UN has some serious concerns about the psi orders after the purge of the Chitra Bhanu, and the presence and effectiveness of the \u00c6on Trinity has carved away from a lot of the humanitarian mission of the UN.<br /> <br /> The chapter on criminal orgs is also amazing, a really cool spread of groups with tons and tons of hooks for engaging with them as antagonists that you can do more than just fight.<br /> <br /> I think my favorite is a group of raiders in La Blessure who rescued a heavily wounded Aberrant who fell with the <i>Esperanza</i> and have been nursing him back to health. They're mostly just people trying to make the best of a horrible situation and save their community and the people who live there, but as things get more desperate they're getting more desperate and violent. Living in La Blessure and near a powerful Aberrant are causing mutations to occur, isolating them from other communities, and the people they prey on correctly assume the Aberrant with them was involved in the <i>Esperanza</i> attack. The Aberrant has amnesia due to brain damage, but has developed genuine positive connections to people and the community at large. It's such a great setup for a story with lots of different ways for things to play out.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4270-literatzi","name":"literatzi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4270_2.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"177"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-29T20:59:17-07:00","id":1491863,"title":"","content":"Yeah. I've read most of it, and I like the fact that there are very few groups that are &quot;pure evil&quot;. I also like t4eh fact that they're playing up the idea that a lot of Nova tech, stuff designed by high quantum, high mega intelligent novas has a lot of &quot;undocumented features.&quot; It's not the UN and Aeon being killjoys, there's stuff out there that is just incomprehensible and dangerous. <br /> <br /> And I love the idea of a company that is waste disposal for Novatgech, and I now will have two new NPC's--Dakota and Cavandish, to keep collecting it and bumping into the PCs. (a no prize for anyone who gets the reference.)<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1458-newk","name":"NewK","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"360"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-29T21:13:21-07:00","id":1491865,"title":"","content":"Pistachios<br /> <br /> (Would Milo be an anti-Talent?)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-30T04:40:38-07:00","id":1491889,"title":"","content":"Well, I just want to bring to attention something that blew my mind due to the potential repercussions.<br /> <br /> SPOILERS<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> A gland that allows a psion to transform Quantum into Psi?! I'm the only one that thinks that's overpowered? I mean, sure, it's illegal tech and has side effects, but think about what would happen if the technology is perfected and becomes public. Does this mean that a legionnaire could potentially absorb a quantum blast and turn it into fuel for their power? And now that the concept has been introduced, is the reverse possible? Could an Aberrant absorb Psi and turn it into Quantum? Hell, how about Talents and inspiration? I'm just curious about what your opinions are. <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2964-firanai","name":"Firanai","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2964_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"672"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-30T06:25:37-07:00","id":1491898,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Firanai</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1491574-mission-statements?p=1491889#post1491889\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Well, I just want to bring to attention something that blew my mind due to the potential repercussions.<br /> <br /> SPOILERS<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> A gland that allows a psion to transform Quantum into Psi?! I'm the only one that thinks that's overpowered? I mean, sure, it's illegal tech and has side effects, but think about what would happen if the technology is perfected and becomes public. Does this mean that a legionnaire could potentially absorb a quantum blast and turn it into fuel for their power? And now that the concept has been introduced, is the reverse possible? Could an Aberrant absorb Psi and turn it into Quantum? Hell, how about Talents and inspiration? I'm just curious about what your opinions are.</div> </div> </div> </div>There is a psi power that turn quantum into psi, it\u2019s the 3 dot power of Fundamentals Quantakinetic mode . And you could even combine it with the one that absorbs quantum powers or energy and turn it all into psi.<br /> Quantakinesis probably can do the reverse too, turning their own psi into quantum, and so probably someone else psi. In thesis a nova can\u2019t manipulate psi, but if you allow, you could use Absorption or a variation of Quantum Leech to drain psi from a psi source, or Inspiration from a Talent.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-30T14:02:55-07:00","id":1491947,"title":"","content":"And I like that , because remember that it's canon that most species transcend (or kill themselves, or go stagnant) within 10,000 years of developing technology--but humanity is <i>special.</i> so the idea that even decades after we first learn about this, people are starting to jail break various abilities, isn't impossible--and also explains why the Doyen are seriously moving to &quot;kill it with fire.&quot;<br /> <br /> The one that gets me interested is <br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"> The group that can turn some neutrals into latents. That's step one--how long beore they can turn latents into psiads, or even full neutrals into latents and psiads. That's a hugely game changing potential. <br /> </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1458-newk","name":"NewK","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"360"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-09-01T02:37:14-07:00","id":1492082,"title":"","content":"Still leafling through it, but I fouond something that left me baffled: Huang-Marr corporation. This much does the current edition disregard the previous one that ignores a full campaing?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26301-sothus","name":"Sothus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26301_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":1,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"15"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-09-01T03:32:55-07:00","id":1492083,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sothus</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1491574-mission-statements?p=1492082#post1492082\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Still leafling through it, but I fouond something that left me baffled: Huang-Marr corporation. This much does the current edition disregard the previous one that ignores a full campaing?</div> </div> </div> </div>If I\u2019m parsing what you\u2019re asking correctly, H-M metacorporation is inspired by the 1e conspiracy and various names/elements will be familiar, but it almost entirely disregards the \u2018psi orders are corrupted, shadowy conspiracies\u2019 elements of the campaign.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Writer. Developer.</i> <b>World of Darkness</b> | <b>Chronicles of Darkness</b> | <b>The Trinity Continuum</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/156-bunyip","name":"Bunyip","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar156_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1880"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-09-01T06:51:42-07:00","id":1492090,"title":"","content":"Quick question about organization scale. Why don\u2019t the single person isn\u2019t Scale 1, as for all the human scales? I mean, it make sense to use 1-6 scale, but than it is listed a regular person there as scale 0.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-09-01T19:15:39-07:00","id":1492129,"title":"","content":"Huang-Marr\u2019s still a thing? Holy shit, that\u2019s <i>awesome</i>. I really loved them as villains, in 1e.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12219-demigod-beast","name":"Demigod Beast","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-09-02T06:30:34-07:00","id":1492155,"title":"","content":"Huang-Marr is just a corporation now. No mustache-twirling, evil conspiracy stuff here.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8890-nullapostle","name":"NullApostle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8890_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-09-02T09:24:57-07:00","id":1492167,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>NullApostle</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1491574-mission-statements?p=1492155#post1492155\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Huang-Marr is just a corporation now. No mustache-twirling, evil conspiracy stuff here.</div> </div> </div> </div>I never played them that way. They were after profit. They were...ethically \u2018relaxed\u2019 about they <i>earned</i> those profits. But evil? No. Just <i>hideously</i> misguided, in thinking Aberrants can be manipulated the way neutrals and psions can.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12219-demigod-beast","name":"Demigod Beast","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1154"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}